         <dc:title>
            <rdf:Alt>
               <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">MB8S - Bridge Rectifiers, 0.5 A</rdf:li>
            </rdf:Alt>
         </dc:title>
         <dc:creator>
            <rdf:Seq>
               <rdf:li>onsemi</rdf:li>
            </rdf:Seq>
         </dc:creator>
         <dc:description>
            <rdf:Alt>
               <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">The MB family of bridge rectifiers is a 0.5â€‰A rectifier family that achieves high surge current absorption within a very small foot print. Within its small 35 mm2 form factor, the MB family shines in its surge capability. In order to absorb high surge currents, the design supports aâ€‰35â€‰A IFSM rating and a 5.0 A2Sec I2T rating. Devices in the family are also rated to breakdown voltages of up to 1000â€‰V. These features make the MB family ideal for small power supplies that need a little extra surge capability.</rdf:li>
            </rdf:Alt>
         </dc:description>
         <xmpMM:DocumentID>uuid:42ceeeec-4251-4588-a0d0-e88d4a513cf0</xmpMM:DocumentID>
         <xmpMM:InstanceID>uuid:76e2b238-36bf-41c6-938b-9cd8bdb2b7db</xmpMM:InstanceID>
      </rdf:Description>
   </rdf:RDF>
